{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "25b90ef7-fce1-8c7a-beed-cd8d392de5bc",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T11:31:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yusuf Nguyen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:25:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:25:48-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Bottom line, my street hasn't been plowed since the storm. Kay Street. It's Wednesday and I'm still looking at a sheet of ice out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:26:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Kay Street. Which storm are we talking about, the one over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:26:14-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the one Sunday into Monday. Snow, then it turned to rain, then everything froze up. Two days now and nobody's come down the street. Not once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:26:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. And do you have a number on Kay Street so I can get the spot right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:26:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "316 Kay Street. Up on the Hill, a couple houses down from the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:26:51-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three sixteen Kay Street, Historic Hill. Got it. And when you say not plowed at all, is it totally untouched, or did somebody make a pass and miss some of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:27:10-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Untouched. There's one lane where people have driven it down to packed ice, and that's it. No plow, no salt, nothing. I've got tenants trying to get out to work and one of them almost went into a parked car yesterday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:27:35-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that packed stuff after rain is nasty. Okay, so I'm writing this down. Kay Street, no plow pass since Monday, packed ice, cars sliding. Anything else on the street I should note? Hydrant buried, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:27:58-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I can see. Just the road. Look, I want this logged. I don't need a speech, I need it on the list so somebody actually shows up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:28:16-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Totally fair. It's going on the list right now, with your address and the details. I'll flag the ice since that's the safety piece."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:28:31-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because honestly it's costing me. I bowl Thursday nights, league, and I can't even get the car out without a production. I've missed warmups twice and my average is dropping."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:28:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, we can't have that. What's the average these days?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:28:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Doesn't matter. It's lower than it was. Anyway, when's somebody coming?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:29:04-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the crews work through the streets by priority, main roads first, then the side streets and the hilly ones. Kay Street's a smaller one, so it tends to come later. I'd say a day or so, maybe sooner if the ice gets bumped up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:29:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or so. Okay. That's not nothing but it's not great either."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:29:39-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Do you want a call back when it's been done, or you'd rather just look out the window?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:29:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Window's fine. Actually, no, take my number in case they have a question about the location. It's 401-555-0157."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:30:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five seven. Name on that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:30:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yusuf Nguyen. N-G-U-Y-E-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:30:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yusuf Nguyen, got it. And you're the owner there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:30:19-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Landlord. I own the building, I don't live in it. But I'm over there a lot this week because of the ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:30:33-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, landlord, 316 Kay. One more thing, if you've got a walkway issue on your own property, that's on you to sand, but the road itself is ours. Just so you know where the line is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:30:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I've already got the walk done. I put down salt Tuesday morning. It's the road I'm calling about."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:31:07-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Then you're all set on your end. I've got the request in. Kay Street, no plowing since the Sunday-Monday storm, ice, tenants having trouble getting out. That's logged under today's date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:31:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thanks. That's all I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:31:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Mr. Nguyen. Good luck Thursday night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T11:31:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, we'll see. Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
